Z||000081||jlruiz67||06-19-2000||03:28 PM||||This thing could have finished if chris west<BR>would have told us that the Flowmaster that they sell was modified and NOT made for Fieros in the first place. I was going to get there "Modified Flowmaster" I was shoping and doing research on a replacement for my bad muffler and was going to pay the $140 that they asked. After reading there post I found it misleading and arogant, Stimpy posted "As far as the folks at West Coast saying it to yer face, yep they prolly would. Does that make me less likely to do business with them? Not hardly. These guys are well organized, know their business, and are perfectionists. And yes, they speak bluntly. I'd rather do my business with someone that provides excellent quality and value and is a bit brusque then someone who would kiss my ass then screw me. If they state they are selling a Flowmaster muffler, then its a Flowmaster. Just because the folks in Santa Rosa do not want to invest in stocking ad marketing a product with a small demand, doesn't preclude them making it as a special order.<BR>Give em hell WestCoast, and keep on building the fiercest fieros around!"<P>Just because some one post that they are selling a flowmaster, doesn't mean that it is real. (it doesn't mean that it is not eighter) When I looked at Al's post I decided to check out what he was posting and it looks like that will be the way to go for me. I will NEVER purchase any item from WestCoast, not because they offended me alone but because they are not as honest in responding to the post as Flowmaster is, they should have told us that the Flowmaster that they where selling was "Modified" to fit the Fiero and tell us why we should purchase his product, insted he gets off by insulting us and not giving us the information that we need to make a smart decision on a expensive purchase. His product is over prices when compared to the $72 Thru Flowmaster sold by summit. (check Al's postings)<BR>I don't need anyone kissing my Ass then screw me. But I also don't like someone insulting me and then screw me. $120(5 user discount $140 regular) vs $72 by summit. Now tell me who wants to get screwed here. <P>Sorry for the rambling <BR>Thanks ||||reg||1
